</span>Primeiro contato: bem acima da média</span></li><li><span data-slot="ds-status-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-ds-4 rounded-ds-tags px-ds-8 py-ds-4 font-ds-inter text-ds-caption leading-none font-medium bg-ds-amber-wash text-ds-amber-ink"><span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ds-tangerine" aria-hidden="true"></span>3 notas repetidas</span></li></ul></li><li class="space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="min-w-0 truncate font-medium">Bruno Martins de Almeida</p><span class="shrink-0 tabular-nums text-sm text-muted-foreground">120 pts</span></div><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><li><span data-slot="ds-status-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-ds-4 rounded-ds-tags px-ds-8 py-ds-4 font-ds-inter text-ds-caption leading-none font-medium bg-ds-amber-wash text-ds-amber-ink"><span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ds-tangerine" aria-hidden="true"></span>2 contatos estranhos</span></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-ds-12"><div data-slot="ds-section-header" class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-ds-12"><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="font-ds-inter text-ds-body-lg font-semibold text-ds-charcoal">Últimos pontos</h2><p class="mt-ds-4 font-ds-inter text-ds-body text-ds-fog">Estornar tira o ponto do placar e do nível. Fica registrado quem estornou e por quê.</p></div></div><ul class="divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate"><span class="font-medium">Ana Souza Ribeiro</span> · Primeiro contato com Maria Nova</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">24/10, 11:05</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="tabular-nums font-medium">+15</span><button type="button" data-slot="ds-outlined-action-button" class="ct-press inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-ds-inter text-ds-body font-medium outline-none transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform] duration-[var(--duration-quick)] ease-[var(--ease-smooth-out)] select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ds-electric-blue/40 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 rounded-ds-buttons border border-ds-ash bg-ds-canvas-white px-ds-16 py-ds-12 text-ds-charcoal hover:bg-ds-paper-mist">Estornar</button></div></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate"><span class="font-medium">Bruno Martins de Almeida</span> · note.service</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">24/10, 08:30</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="tabular-nums text-muted-foreground line-through">+3</span><span data-slot="ds-status-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-ds-4 rounded-ds-tags px-ds-8 py-ds-4 font-ds-inter text-ds-caption leading-none font-medium bg-ds-paper-mist text-ds-steel"><span class="size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ds-steel" aria-hidden="true"></span>Estornado</span></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

